OL,3,AKeir Starmer announces he is standing
OL,4,Adown as MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Keir Starmer has announced he is to
OL,7,Fstand down as MP for Holborn and St
OL,8,FPancras, a move that will trigger a
OL,9,Fby-election in the London seat.
OL,11,FIn a statement to the Camden New
OL,12,FJournal newspaper, he said it had been
OL,13,Fa "huge honour and privilege" to
OL,14,Frepresent the constituency for 11 years
OL,15,Fbut he would now turn his focus to
OL,16,F"international affairs".
OL,18,FSir Keir stood down as prime minister
OL,19,Fearlier in the summer, with Andy
OL,20,FBurnham replacing him.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
