OL,3,AKeir Starmer announces he is standing
OL,4,Adown as MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt follows weeks of speculation about
OL,7,Fwhether Sir Keir would remain as MP
OL,8,Ffollowing his resignation.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
