OL,3,ABurnham to address MPs for first time
OL,4,Aas PM, as government borrowing costs
OL,5,Arise again
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham will address the House of
OL,8,FCommons - and take questions from MPs -
OL,9,Ffor the first time as prime minister
OL,10,Fthis afternoon
OL,12,FMeanwhile, UK borrowing costs have
OL,13,Frisen again - the rate for a 10-year
OL,14,Floan to the British government has
OL,15,Frisen to 5.23%, the highest since 2008
OL,17,FBurnham met his cabinet this morning as
OL,18,FMPs return to Westminster after the
OL,19,Fsummer recess
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
