OL,3,AMan in court charged with murder after
OL,4,Afire deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 23-year-old man has appeared in court
OL,7,Fcharged with murdering a woman and her
OL,8,Fseven-year-old niece who died in a
OL,9,Fhouse fire.
OL,11,FNatalie McDonald, 34, died in the blaze
OL,12,Fin Grangetown, near Middlesbrough, in
OL,13,Fthe early hours of 26 August, along
OL,14,Fwith Valentina Foster.
OL,16,FJaden Wright appeared at Teesside
OL,17,FMagistrates' Court charged with two
OL,18,Fcounts of murder as well as multiple
OL,19,Fgrievous bodily harm offences.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
