OL,3,AThe final minutes before floodwater
OL,4,Acrashed through Nepal-China border
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe video lasts only seconds.
OL,8,FA dark wall appears from behind the
OL,9,Fbuildings at Gyirong, on the Chinese
OL,10,Fside of the Nepal-Tibet border. At
OL,11,Ffirst, it looks almost like a black
OL,12,Fcloud. Then it gathers shape and speed:
OL,13,Fwater, mud, boulders, ice and rock
OL,14,Fsurging down the valley. The timestamp
OL,15,Fon the CCTV footage reads 10:59:53
OL,16,Flocal time.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
